{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-83276","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115419","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-83277","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115420","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-83278","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115421","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-83279","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115422","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-83280","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-83281","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115423","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-83282","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115424","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-83283","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115425","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115426","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-115427","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-115428","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-115429","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-115430","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-115431","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-115432","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-115433","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-115434","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83284","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115435","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-83285","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115436","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115437","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-115438","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-115439","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83286","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115440","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-83287","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115441","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115442","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-115443","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-115444","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83288","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115445","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-83289","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115446","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115447","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-115448","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-115449","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83290","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115450","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-83291","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115451","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115452","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-115453","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-115454","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83292","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115455","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-83293","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83295","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115456","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-115457","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-115458","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-115459","text":", "},{"id":"spn-115460","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-115461","text":", "},{"id":"spn-115462","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-115463","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-83294","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83297","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115464","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-115465","text":": "},{"id":"spn-115466","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-115467","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-83296","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83299","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115468","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-115469","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-83298","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83301","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115470","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-115471","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-115472","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-115473","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-115474","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-115475","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-83300","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83303","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115476","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-115477","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-115478","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-115479","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-83302","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83305","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115480","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-115481","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-115482","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-115483","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-83304","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83307","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115484","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-115485","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-115486","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-115487","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-115488","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-115489","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-83306","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera7pqb7sd7fdsx6uxsmk7mn3ryacv57yoz3x6x2xwkvbqzx76tniha","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}